ppJTIwJTI4MjAyMCUyOS8.1.4","title":"The doctor of deceit?","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2020-03-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With the cops struggling to find evidence in the case, Sameera takes the matter into her own hands. As Anurag struggles to mend the strained relationship with his son, Sameera goes to Mumbai to dig into his past.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rgtJ16l5vAyY069T2rNPhiNjqh2.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL01hcnppJTIwJTI4MjAyMCUyOS8.1.5","title":"Nothing to lose!","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2020-03-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The worst kind of betrayal is the one from your loved ones! Already on the edge, a distraught Sameera finds out the shocking truth about her sister and all hell breaks loose. With no one to turn to, Sameera is now dangerously close to playing with fire.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yqZ5UV8ETC4gCfN5bSioflHpEXp.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL01hcnppJTIwJTI4MjAyMCUyOS8.1.6","title":"The collision course","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2020-03-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The secrets are out, the lies are laid bare. With nothing to lose, Sameera and Anurag are now clashing head-on and only one of them will survive this devious Game of Lies!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cGeUB3ylpqRqDPiY8coJCepJcDd.jpg"}]}}